[0.002, "o", "\u001b[1;33mObservation\u001b[0m \u001b[33m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;33mTool:\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0mfile_editor\r\n\u001b[1;33mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m[File /Users/alessioricco/certo-demo/projects/wordle/README.md edited with 1 changes.]\u001b[0m\r\n[begin of edit 1 / 1]\r\n(content before edit)\r\n\u001b[31m 1|\u001b[0m\r\n(content after edit)\r\n\u001b[32m+1|# Terminal Wordle\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m 2|\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m+3|A small Wordle game for the terminal, written in Python using only the standard library at \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32mruntime.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m+4|\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m+5|## Requirements\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m+6|\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m+7|- Python 3.10 or newer\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m+8|- `pytest` to run the test suite\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m+9|\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m+10|Create and activate a virtual environment, then install the test dependency:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m+11|\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m+12|```bash\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m+13|python -m venv .venv\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[3"]
