[0.000, "o", "nment with `.venv\\\\Scripts\\\\Activate.ps1` instead.\r\n    19  \r\n    20  ## Play\r\n    21  \r\n    22  From the project directory, run:\r\n    23  \r\n    24  ```bash\r\n    25  python wordle.py\r\n    26  ```\r\n    27  \r\n    28  The game chooses a five-letter word and gives you six guesses. Enter exactly five letters \r\nfor each guess. Each letter is reported as:\r\n    29  \r\n    30  - `correct`: the letter is in the right position;\r\n    31  - `present`: the letter is in the answer, but in another position;\r\n    32  - `absent`: the letter is not available in the answer.\r\n    33  \r\n    34  Invalid-length guesses do not use a turn. Press Ctrl-D (or Ctrl-Z then Enter on Windows) to \r\nend input, or Ctrl-C to quit; the game exits with a goodbye message.\r\n    35  \r\n    36  ## Tests\r\n    37  \r\n    38  Run the complete test suite with:\r\n    39  \r\n    40  ```bash\r\n    41  python -m pytest\r\n    42  ```\r\n    43  \r\n\r\n\r\n"]
